abstract: >-
  73,070 structured research findings machine-extracted from 6,244 canonical papers,
  with canonicalized entities, source attribution, and discovery tables. This checkpoint combines
  the completed Tier 1 record with 81 of 146 Tier 2 chunks. Every Tier 2 and combined figure is a
  subset figure. Verbatim provenance text remains the copyright of its authors and publishers.
